      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e So I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s worth complicating the logic in pkvm_host_use_dma() for such a corner case.\n\nOr maybe not necessarily complicating it but making it less performant. I see e.g. the RMRR on our PTL platform is 136MB in size, so if we called pkvm_pgtable_map() for each OWNED page in the loop in pkvm_host_use_dma() instead of calling it once at the end, we would be calling it 34K times, and we would be mapping it with 4K pages instead of 2M pages...",
